Hello fellow NHSOUNDERS,
   The first basic key is to use your sound card's own ct-voice.drv (if
using a clone try to snag the ct-voice.drv that came with the basic SB).
The one that came with it I believe was for either the SBPro or SB and
definitely did not like my SB16ASP, but once I replaced the driver it
worked fine.
   Remember when gathering sounds to keep them under 32k or the
installation will hang.  
   I just recently got a reply from Samuli, the creator of NHSOUND, and
he's either just finnished his tour of duty in the army or is in the
middle of it.  It sounds like he's planning on doing some future
enhancements when he gets some time.
   Have sounds and am on the quest for MORE.  I'll gladly swap
nhsound.cnf vocs with intrested folk.



